h;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l004","ordinal":287435,"en":"Now among the sons of the Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l005","ordinal":287436,"en":"He will never let himself be captured."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l006","ordinal":287437,"en":"Wherever he passed the night,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l007","ordinal":287438,"en":"A deep-rooted plane tree grew;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l008","ordinal":287439,"en":"Beneath it, a sheer cliff rose."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l009","ordinal":287440,"en":"Wherever he stopped to camp,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l010","ordinal":287441,"en":"Poplars as broad as a sheepfold stood."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l011","ordinal":287442,"en":"Any enemy who openly opposed him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l012","ordinal":287443,"en":"Never prospered or multiplied."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l013","ordinal":287444,"en":"“This Choro has struck at the twins;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l014","ordinal":287445,"en":"Perhaps he will never thrive,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l015","ordinal":287446,"en":"But will rescue heroes, ruin nations,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l016","ordinal":287447,"en":"And plunge us into suffering;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l017","ordinal":287448,"en":"Perhaps he will poison"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l018","ordinal":287449,"en":"All the Jediger;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l019","ordinal":287450,"en":"Perhaps he will cast them"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l020","ordinal":287451,"en":"Into incurable affliction and turmoil;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l021","ordinal":287452,"en":"Perhaps he will throw"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l022","ordinal":287453,"en":"All these Jediger into the water;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l023","ordinal":287454,"en":"Perhaps he will plunge them"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l024","ordinal":287455,"en":"Into a clamor unknown to men and unseen by nations."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l025","ordinal":287456,"en":"Kanchoro has won such renown,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l026","ordinal":287457,"en":"His quarrel will touch the whole world;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l027","ordinal":287458,"en":"Will he lie still without raising strife?”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l028","ordinal":287459,"en":"The massed black Jediger—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l029","ordinal":287460,"en":"All the Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l030","ordinal":287461,"en":"Young and old—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l031","ordinal":287462,"en":"Considered what would follow and raised an uproar;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l032","ordinal":287463,"en":"Thinking it over, they made a commotion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l033","ordinal":287464,"en":"With evil thoughts about the choro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l034","ordinal":287465,"en":"The Jediger stood there."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l035","ordinal":287466,"en":"Before the Jediger could close their mouths,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l036","ordinal":287467,"en":"Kanchoro came out shouting,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l037","ordinal":287468,"en":"Summoning every last man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l038","ordinal":287469,"en":"Swelling with anger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b003:l039","ordinal":287470,"en":"Against the ill-fated choro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l001","ordinal":287471,"en":"He found counsel as if from the unseen"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l002","ordinal":287472,"en":"And began speaking wrathfully."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l003","ordinal":287473,"en":"When Kanchoro grew fierce—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l004","ordinal":287474,"en":"That cringing madman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l005","ordinal":287475,"en":"That treacherous choro—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l006","ordinal":287476,"en":"He buckled on his unsheathed sword,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l007","ordinal":287477,"en":"Set all his weapons in place,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l008","ordinal":287478,"en":"And made ready to speak."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l009","ordinal":287479,"en":"His black eyes filled with blood;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l010","ordinal":287480,"en":"He roared menacingly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l011","ordinal":287481,"en":"Calling all the massed black Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l012","ordinal":287482,"en":"To come without exception:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l013","ordinal":287483,"en":"“On the plain of Chogulma"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l014","ordinal":287484,"en":"Hold a gathering together;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l015","ordinal":287485,"en":"Devise a plan and find a way."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l016","ordinal":287486,"en":"Bakay Khan is their elder—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l017","ordinal":287487,"en":"Strike down Bakay Khan!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1309:b004:l018","ordinal":287488,"en":"His beard is white as a swan;"}]
